  "description": "Microsoft SQL Server database provider for Rapidex.Data ORM framework.\n\nThis package provides SQL Server specific implementation for the Rapidex.Data framework, enabling full support for Microsoft SQL Server databases.\n\nFeatures:\n• Full SQL Server support for Rapidex.Data\n• Optimized SQL generation for SQL Server\n• Support for SQL Server specific data types\n• Transaction support with SQL Server\n• Multi-schema support\n• Automatic schema creation and updates\n• Connection pooling support\n\nRequires Rapidex.Data package (which includes all necessary dependencies).",
